From: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 22:28:52 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: ath12k: repair legacy HW1 Direct Switch metadata

Select Ethernet RX and negotiated peer metadata only for supported HW1
firmware after native transport registration. Keep association on the CPU
route, then recover source VP from authorized per-MSDU peer metadata,
including A-MSDU continuations. Withhold untrusted descriptors during CPU
recovery and keep transport callbacks non-sleeping.

Signed-off-by: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>
